The PR unified `ProvidersSection._quotaMarks = quotaMarkIds` (which already contained 'dial'). And `QuotaStore._markToQuotaId` remains openrouter+codemie only. So there are two different notions of "quota-marked":
- fa_ui's `quotaMarkIds`: openrouter, codemie, dial (gauge renders for these; service has unmetered dial).
- app's `_markToQuotaId`: openrouter, codemie (probe-able ids).

`confirmEndpoint` correctly probes only openrouter/codemie. `_confirmQuotaFor` in fa_ui probes any of openrouter/codemie/dial — refresh('dial') is a no-op in the app. Slight inconsistency but harmless. Worth a SUGGESTION at most.

