Another subtlety with `refresh`: it COALESCES with in-flight fetches but does NOT respect TTL — refresh always fetches (well, `_fetchOnce` always fetches, no TTL check!). So calling `confirmEndpoint` right after a fresh pull-to-refresh forces another live fetch. Minor, by design ("run once at add time").

